{"sections":[],"metadata":{"role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Instance Method","symbolKind":"method","title":"onPictureInPictureChange(_:)","modules":[{"name":"OptiViewAdsCore"}],"externalID":"s:15OptiViewAdsCore09PictureInE7CapableP02onefE6ChangeyyySbcF","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"onPictureInPictureChange"},{"kind":"text","text":"(("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s4Voida","text":"Void","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"required":true},"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/optiviewadscore\/pictureinpicturecapable\/onpictureinpicturechange(__)"]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/optiviewadscore.OptiViewAdsCore\/documentation\/OptiViewAdsCore\/PictureInPictureCapable\/onPictureInPictureChange(_:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Install the single observer for presentation-mode changes. The handler"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"receives "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"type":"text","text":" when the window opens and "},{"code":"false","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" when it closes,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"whoever drove the transition. Installing replaces any previous handler."}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/optiviewadscore.OptiViewAdsCore\/documentation\/OptiViewAdsCore","doc:\/\/optiviewadscore.OptiViewAdsCore\/documentation\/OptiViewAdsCore\/PictureInPictureCapable"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"onPictureInPictureChange"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"_"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"handler"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"attribute","text":"@escaping"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Void","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s4Voida"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The adapter MUST also invoke the handler once, synchronously or on the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"next main-queue turn, with the CURRENT state at install time. The"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"adapter outlives the SDK session (one player, many sessions), so a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"transition that lands between sessions — the previous session’s window"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"closing late, the next one not yet initialized — is otherwise consumed"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"by the adapter’s own change-dedup with nobody listening, and the new"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"session starts believing the window is closed while the player is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"presenting in it (measured on the iOS e2e fleet, catalog-pip"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"PIP-ENTER-DURING-* @ 0.50.0-beta.506). The renderer’s dedup makes the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"install-time delivery idempotent, so adapters need not special-case"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"“nothing changed”."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"references":{"doc://optiviewadscore.OptiViewAdsCore/documentation/OptiViewAdsCore/PictureInPictureCapable":{"url":"\/documentation\/optiviewadscore\/pictureinpicturecapable","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"tex